t_state_presence","as_of":"2026-10-01","zone":"Kamiji territorial centre (Tshisangu localities)","evidence":"Seat of Kamiji territory with territorial administrator and PNC territorial commissariat; no reports of armed-group presence after the Kamuina Nsapu crisis faded in 2017-2018.","unit":"CD8105-kamiji","run_id":"drc-swarm-1"}],"sources":{},"units":{"CD8105-kamiji":"Kamiji territory (Lomami province), a rural territory between Mwene-Ditu and the Kasai-Central/Kasai-Oriental borders, has no known armed-group territorial control. The Kamuina Nsapu insurgency affected the wider Kasai and Lomami region in 2016-2017 but was suppressed by 2018 without leaving lasting militia control in Kamiji. The territorial centre (Kamiji, around Tshisangu) hosts the territorial administration and a PNC commissariat; villages are run by customary chiefs with PNC posts. Live web research was unavailable in this run (search budget exhausted), so the assessment relies on background knowledge and the default-state-presence rule, with limited confidence."}}